// Program metadata for nix.
//
// kind=host → installed by the profile runner inside arch-chroot as root via
// pacman. Arch Wiki (Nix): install nix and enable nix-daemon.service. Host
// Core ships nixd (Nix LSP) and nixfmt, so nix must be usable: install.sh
// also creates /nix/store (the package does not, and every user-side tool —
// nixd's evaluator included — aborts on a missing store before it ever
// reaches the daemon). No channel is added: that is the operator's choice.

{
  "name": "nix",
  "kind": "host",
  "description": "Nix with nix-daemon and an initialised store.",
  "system_services": ["nix-daemon.service"]
}
